      "side": 1,
      "message": "Just a thought for preparing the migration: Does this need to be a - I assume - FreeType specific index? Or could this be something that identifies a specific `cmap` table in the font? The latter might be compatible with other font libraries. \n\nBut Fontations does have a charmap abstraction as well - but the choice of mapping table is left to the implementation there:\nhttps://docs.rs/skrifa/0.37.0/skrifa/charmap/index.html\n\nMore widely asking, out of curiosity: Why does PDFium need to call into specific character to glyph maps in the font?",
      "revId": "098475a42a947b114746a55eeebfd151d061dd60",
