      "message": "The only caller in third_party/pdfium/xfa/fgas/font/cfgas_fontmgr.cpp wants to see if the unicode charmap has specific chars.\n\nIf the answer is no, the code tries to restore the original selected charmap. So in that sense, the exact meaning here probably doesn\u0027t matter, as long as the index value can be used to perform the restore correctly.\n\nOh, I probably shouldn\u0027t be using size_t here either. Will fix...",
